  × bind:value does not track whether this checkbox is checked.
  
     7 │ </script>
     8 │ 
   > 9 │ <input type="checkbox" bind:value={checked} />
       │                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    10 │ <input type="radio" bind:value={selected} />
    11 │ <input type="CheckBox" bind:value={checked} />
  
  i Users change whether a checkbox is checked, not its value.
  
  i Use bind:checked to track whether this checkbox is checked, or bind:group to track the values of all checked checkboxes in a group.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Use bind:checked instead.
  
     7  7 │   </script>
